To my awesome (but way too big and expensive) legal team:<div><div><br></di=
v>Here are the videos you requested. &nbsp;As you can see they are totally =
consistent with the emails from the supervisors and with the supervisor rep=
orts. Please to do not share as they are so friggin cute heads will explode=
. &nbsp;There&nbsp;is also one in there that that if you look closely has a=
n interesting surprise. The bruises on Evie are clearly inflicted and based=
 on Jackman=E2=80=99s email were done by Tara to accuse me of abuse, in my =
opinion. Though the bruises were there when Evie arrived for the visit and =
we reported right away, Tara also reported them to Jackman&nbsp;very concer=
ned just after the visit. They were so obvious and clearly not accidental, =
it=E2=80=99s hard to imagine her missing them pre-visit, but noticing them =
after. &nbsp;The Walsh story then migrated to...the bruises were normal...a=
nd then most bizarrely Mr. Guttridge wrote a letter to Judge Gordon-Oliver =
stating there were NO bruises and NO history of abuse at the Walsh househol=
d. It=E2=80=99s no wonder this case is such a mess with so much straight up=
 disinformation being thrown at the court. And though I&nbsp;think Tara is =
the most likely person who did this, the mom and dad arehitters and there a=
re a lot of siblings on various meds who might be feeling a little resentme=
nt toward Evie too, given how terribly disruptive her addition must be to t=
heir previous lives.<div><br></div><div><a href=3D"https://vimeo.com/showca=
se/6635856">https://vimeo.com/showcase/6635856</a><br><div><br></div><div>N=
o one can explain to me why Hymowitz was denied the reports relating to&nbs=
p;the videoed visits,&nbsp;&nbsp;just a lot of the word =E2=80=98tainted=E2=
=80=99 being used louder and louder. Delia=E2=80=99s report was tainted, I =
get that, but the Judge used it to end Tara=E2=80=99s supervision. The othe=
r reports are pretty much flat fact and unlike with Delia, the supervisors =
had no&nbsp;interactions with the management folks or access to any of the&=
nbsp;snarky emails that I guess upset people. Delia was a&nbsp;one-woman sh=
ow and boy were there some snarky interactions with her. She&nbsp;acted lik=
e someone&nbsp;important, maybe a small town politico or married to one. &n=
bsp;She flat out told me that the Judge would do whatever she said and my j=
aw dropped,&nbsp;and then she&nbsp;was very inappropriate with Jennifer Jac=
kman when she tried to get Delia to follow the court order. Basically told =
her to stay in her $%&amp;*^ lane.&nbsp;The Judge was actually pretty thoug=
h and impressive on the issue though. &nbsp;Best I have seen her.&nbsp;Def =
not in Delia=E2=80=99s pocket, but I prob&nbsp;messed up not paying Delia. =
That=E2=80=99s kind of the third rail in Westchester court I am learning. &=
nbsp;I am slow...but over time I get it. &nbsp;Still I won=E2=80=99t pay pe=
ople who are corrupt or put my daughter at risk. It is just a line I won=E2=
=80=99t cross.<caret></caret></div><div><br></div><div>The prosecutor I tal=
ked to called it&nbsp;VERY odd that the reports were declared =E2=80=9Ctain=
ted=E2=80=9D and not read,&nbsp;but was much more interested in Griffin and=
 Delia F. and who made the decision to select them etc and why. I told them=
 what I knew, but I think they already had most of it. &nbsp;The Hymowitz s=
tuff was also interesting, but I think they are probably going to reach out=
 to him&nbsp;directly. That poor guy. He is very scared of offending the co=
urt, but I think if he had just been honest with the Judge, she would have =
have let him just comment on the false abuse and drug use allegations, Tara=
=E2=80=99s BPD,&nbsp;and the fact that I am basically Mr. Mom thanks to my =
awsome Mom. &nbsp;Then&nbsp;he could have had more time to double check Mr.=
 Griffin=E2=80=99s =E2=80=9Cinvestigation=E2=80=9D and to review the crazy =
Walsh abuse stuff. &nbsp;I am not sure if you saw, but in that pile there i=
s an exchange between&nbsp;Tara and Kiara her then&nbsp;12 year old sister =
also claimed&nbsp;in a text that she was having Lithium and Seroquel put in=
 her food...just like Tara did to me. That was in March 2017. &nbsp;Yikes!<=
/div><div><br></div>Will someone please save my daughter from this awful fa=
mily.&nbsp;<div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Steve<br><br></div></di=
v></div></div>
